It has to pass security and compliance. 

267
00:26:20,960 --> 00:26:26,720
The leaders of the company who are further away 
from the AI revolution are forward-looking,  

268
00:26:26,720 --> 00:26:31,120
but they have to say, "Oh, it makes 
sense for us to spend 50 million. 

269
00:26:31,120 --> 00:26:35,120
This is what this Claude Code thing is.
This is why it helps our company. 

270
00:26:35,120 --> 00:26:37,680
This is why it makes us more productive."
Then they have to explain  

271
00:26:37,680 --> 00:26:42,800
