They have to say, "Okay, we have 3,000 developers. 

272
00:26:42,800 --> 00:26:45,200
Here's how we're going to roll 
it out to our developers." 

273
00:26:45,200 --> 00:26:50,480
We have conversations like this every day.
We are doing everything we can to make  

274
00:26:50,480 --> 00:26:55,760
Anthropic's revenue grow 20 or 
30x a year instead of 10x a year. 

275
00:26:57,440 --> 00:27:01,440
Again, many enterprises are just 
saying, "This is so productive. 

276
00:27:02,160 --> 00:27:05,120
We're going to take shortcuts in 
our usual procurement process." 

277
00:27:05,120 --> 00:27:08,560
They're moving much faster than 
when we tried to sell them just  

278
00:27:08,560 --> 00:27:13,760
the ordinary API, which many of them use.
Claude Code is a more compelling product,  

279
00:27:13,760 --> 00:27:19,120
but it's not an infinitely compelling product.
I don't think even AGI or powerful AI or  

280
00:27:19,120 --> 00:27:22,960
"country of geniuses in a data center" 
will be an infinitely compelling product. 

281
00:27:22,960 --> 00:27:28,480
It will be a compelling product enough maybe to 
get 3-5x, or 10x, a year of growth, even when  

282
00:27:28,480 --> 00:27:32,080
