I buy that it would be a slight slowdown. 

284
00:27:36,640 --> 00:27:39,440
Maybe this is not your claim, but 
sometimes people talk about this like,  

285
00:27:39,440 --> 00:27:45,200
"Oh, the capabilities are there, but because of 
diffusion... otherwise we're basically at AGI". 

286
00:27:46,160 --> 00:27:49,360
I don't believe we're basically at AGI.
I think if you had the "country  

287
00:27:49,360 --> 00:27:53,840
of geniuses in a data center"...
If we had the "country of geniuses  

288
00:27:53,840 --> 00:27:57,360
in a data center", we would know it.
We would know it if you had the  

289
00:27:57,360 --> 00:28:01,600
"country of geniuses in a data center".
Everyone in this room would know it. 

290
00:28:01,600 --> 00:28:07,760
Everyone in Washington would know it.
People in rural parts might not know it,  

291
00:28:07,760 --> 00:29:36,720
but we would know it. We don't 
have that now. That is very clear. 

292
00:29:42,400 --> 00:29:47,360
Coming back to concrete prediction… Because there 
are so many different things to disambiguate,  

