capabilities we should think about soon. 

303
00:30:32,160 --> 00:30:36,560
Maybe I'll ask about it in the context of a job 
I understand well, not because it's the most  

304
00:30:36,560 --> 00:30:42,080
relevant job, but just because I can evaluate 
the claims about it. Take video editors. I have  

305
00:30:42,080 --> 00:30:47,920
video editors. Part of their job involves 
learning about our audience's preferences,  

306
00:30:47,920 --> 00:30:50,800
learning about my preferences and tastes, 
and the different trade-offs we have. 

307
00:30:50,800 --> 00:30:54,880
They’re, over the course of many months, 
building up this understanding of context. 

308
00:30:55,600 --> 00:30:58,960
The skill and ability they have six 
months into the job, a model that can  

309
00:30:58,960 --> 00:31:03,760
