This gets back to what we were talking about  

337
00:33:28,000 --> 00:33:33,600
before with learning on the job. It's very 
interesting. I think with the coding agents,  

338
00:33:34,160 --> 00:33:39,920
I don't think people would say that learning on 
the job is what is preventing the coding agents  

339
00:33:39,920 --> 00:33:46,160
