other economic activity doesn't. 

350
00:34:37,600 --> 00:34:44,800
But when you say that, what you're implying is 
that by reading the codebase into the context,  

351
00:34:44,800 --> 00:34:48,080
I have everything that the human 
needed to learn on the job. 

352
00:34:48,080 --> 00:34:54,400
So that would be an example of—whether it's 
written or not, whether it's available or  

353
00:34:54,400 --> 00:34:59,360
not—a case where everything you needed 
to know you got from the context window. 

354
00:35:00,640 --> 00:35:05,280
What we think of as learning—"I started this job, 
it's going to take me six months to understand the  

355
00:35:05,280 --> 00:35:09,200
code base"—the model just did it in the context.
I honestly don't know how to think about  

356
00:35:09,200 --> 00:35:13,920
