These tools make us a lot more productive. 

372
00:36:30,960 --> 00:36:34,000
Why do you think we're concerned 
about competitors using the tools? 

373
00:36:34,000 --> 00:36:43,520
Because we think we're ahead of the competitors.
We wouldn't be going through all this trouble if  

374
