We see the end productivity every few  

375
00:36:49,600 --> 00:36:54,320
months in the form of model launches.
There's no kidding yourself about this. 

376
00:36:54,320 --> 00:37:00,640
The models make you more productive.
1) People feeling like they're productive is  

377
00:37:00,640 --> 00:37:04,720
