But 2) if I just look at the end output,  

378
00:37:04,720 --> 00:37:10,560
obviously you guys are making fast progress.
But the idea was supposed to be that with  

379
00:37:10,560 --> 00:37:14,160
recursive self-improvement, you make 
a better AI, the AI helps you build a  

380
00:37:14,160 --> 00:37:18,880
better next AI, et cetera, et cetera.
What I see instead—if I look at you,  

381
00:37:18,880 --> 00:37:22,960
OpenAI, DeepMind—is that people are just 
